  "description": "Are you looking for a higher-end Urban model with hydraulic disc brakes and a dedicated 1x drive-train? From quick trips to local stores, to daily commutes to work, and all that urban life requires in between, the 2022 Beasley 27.5\" DLX delivers with a sophisticated feel for amazing rides in any urban environment. Features include new MicroSHIFT \"1x\" components that make shifting sharp with a wide capacity 10-speed cassette, Kenda Kwick 2.0 tires and Radius hydraulic disc brakes, which ensure short braking distances in all weather conditions. In stark contrast to the regular Beasley 27.5, the 2022 DLX version features a gloss silver paint finish that makes it stand out...\nHaro Beasley 27.5\" X6 series, tapered head tube\nInternal 1.5T Threadless tapered headset\nRigid 27.5\" 6000 Series tapered alloy fork\n2-pc Aluminum crankset w/ 38T Narrow-Wide chainring\nMicroshift RD-M6205GM 10-spd rear derailleur w/ clutch\nMicroshift SL-M9505-R 10-spd right shifter\nMicroshift CS-H104 11-48T 10-spd cassette\nMX-21 Aluminum double wall rims, 27mm wide\nJoy-Tech aluminum cassette 32h hubs\nKenda Kwick Seven.5 27.5x2.0\" tires\nRadius hydraulic brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
